I personally think that (unless I'm lawful) getting a stack of
poisoned darts in the early/mid game is far more important than
getting 300HP in the end game.  Therefore, in the early/mid game, I
will mix unidentified potions together until I get a potion of
sickness, even though this might screw up the number of full healing
potions I could alchemize in the end game.  Honestly, by the time I'm
ready to alchemize a stack of full healing potions, I really don't
need 300HP anymore.  However, I do think that having a stack of
poisoned darts can help me survive the hard part of the game, which
happens to be the whole chunk of the game before the castle wand.



